Security / policy notes honored
•	The knowledge index contains only public banking policy/FAQ information.
•	No customer-specific data (CustomerId, balances, transactions, loans, cards, PINs, credentials, sessions, etc.) are placed into the knowledge index.
•	The existing authentication/authorization architecture is preserved. BankingService continues to use ICurrentUserAccessor for customer-scoped tools. The RAG layer is used only for public information.
•	The MCP tool does not directly call Azure; MCP -> IBankingService -> IKnowledgeSearchService -> Azure.
